## Permissions

For the MRA these are of the form `<resource>:<action>`.

Where `<resource>` and `<action>` are each a series of dash-separated words.
Words may contain alpha-numeric characters as well as dashes (ie. a-z/0-9/-).

For example to give permission to read a movie the required permission is of the form
`movie:read`.

The following permissions are defined:

|PERMISSION|DESCRIPTION|
|-|-|
{{#permissions}}
|`{{name}}`|{{description}}|
{{/permissions}}

**Individual end-points define which permissions are required**

