## Error Codes

### 4xx Errors

These indicate an issue with the request originating in some way from the client. In this case, the
result will contain an ErrorResponse object containing an error code.

#### Common Error Codes

The following may be returned by any endpoint:

|CODE|DESCRIPTION|
|-|-|
{{#error_codes}}
|`{{code}}`|{{description}}|
{{/error_codes}}

#### Custom Error Codes

Additional error codes may be returned for a given endpoint. **See the associated end-point
description for further details**.

### 5xx Errors

Indicate a server-side issue and have no guaranteed returned type. These are purposefully not
described in detail to the client for security reasons.